---
import DayRing from './DayRing.astro';
import MacroBar from './MacroBar.astro';
---
<section id="promises" class="why wrap" aria-labelledby="promises-title">
  <div class="frame">
    <h2 id="promises-title" class="head" data-reveal>Why it sticks</h2>

    <div class="board">
      <article class="tile tile--7" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__ui tile__ui--ring" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="close">
            <DayRing target={2100} tol={100} planned={2052} eaten={1264} />
            <div class="close__n nums"><strong>2,052</strong><span>lands, of 2,100</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>Close counts</h3><p>Every target has its own ± range. Land anywhere inside it and the day is a win. The band is on the ring, with an edge at each end, so you can see it.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--5" data-reveal style="--i:1">
        <div class="tile__ui" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mode mode--plan">Planning</div>
          <div class="mode mode--log">Logging</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>Your plan is never overwritten</h3><p>Planned and eaten are two different numbers, side by side, and the two modes look nothing alike. Nothing counts until you log it.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--5" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__ui" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <ul class="foods">
            <li><span>Greek yogurt, nonfat</span><span class="match"><span class="seal"></span>Matched · USDA</span></li>
            <li><span>Almond butter</span><span class="match match--label"><span class="seal"></span>Manually verified</span></li>
            <li><span>Banana bread</span><span class="match match--est">Estimate · to match</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>Numbers you can trust</h3><p>You pick every USDA match or photograph the label. An estimate is shown as one until you do.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--7" data-reveal style="--i:1">
        <div class="tile__ui" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="offrow">
            <span class="offrow__mark"></span>
            <div class="offrow__line"><strong>Lunch</strong><span class="nums">799 kcal</span></div>
            <div class="offrow__line offrow__sub nums"><span>58P · 88C · 24F</span><span class="chip">Off plan · +237 kcal</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="offverdict"><strong>Calories over 193.</strong> Two meals ahead can absorb it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>Off plan isn't failure</h3><p>Eat something unplanned and the day says so in plain words. Then the meals ahead re-size: the same food in new amounts, and you see every change first.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--4" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__ui" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="stepper nums"><span>−</span><strong>250 g</strong><span>+</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>No serving sizes to guess</h3><p>Portions are amounts, on a 5 g grid unless you set another, and shown in ounces, cups or spoons if you prefer.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--4" data-reveal style="--i:1">
        <div class="tile__ui tile__ui--bar" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <MacroBar name="Fat" target={70} tol={15} planned={76} eaten={36} floats />
          <p class="floats">Floats · balanced last</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>One number gets to give</h3><p>Let a macro float. It's balanced last and never marks your day off. You choose the order the rest land in.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--4" data-reveal style="--i:2">
        <div class="tile__ui" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
          <ul class="set">
            <li><span>iCloud sync</span><span>On</span></li>
            <li><span>Account</span><span>None</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="tile__cap"><h3>No account, no tracking</h3><p>Your data lives on your phone and in your iCloud. Claude and USDA are reached directly, never through a server of ours.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why { margin-top: var(--section); }
  /* The app's own surfaces: cards on the page's ground, one radius, nothing tinted. Each card leads with the
     piece of interface it's about, at the size it is in the app, and its heading says what that means. */
  .board { margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .tile { background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 2rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.75rem; min-height: 19rem; }
  .tile--7 { grid-column: span 7; }
  .tile--5 { grid-column: span 5; }
  .tile--4 { grid-column: span 4; }
  .tile__cap h3 { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.375rem; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .tile__cap p { margin-top: 0.4rem; color: var(--label2); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 44ch; }
  .tile__ui { flex: 1; display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 10px; }

  [data-ui] .close { position: relative; width: min(100%, 15rem); justify-self: center; }
  [data-ui] .close__n { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; }
  [data-ui] .close__n strong { font-family: var(--font-mark); font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; color: var(--eaten); }
  [data-ui] .close__n span { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--label2); }

  [data-ui] .mode { padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center; }
  [data-ui] .mode--plan { color: var(--label2); border: 1.5px dashed var(--label3); }
  [data-ui] .mode--log { color: var(--eaten); border: 1.5px solid var(--eaten); }

  [data-ui] .foods { display: grid; font-size: 15px; }
  [data-ui] .foods li { display: grid; gap: 2px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--separator); }
  [data-ui] .foods li:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  [data-ui] .match { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--eaten); }
  [data-ui] .match--est { color: var(--amber); }
  [data-ui] .seal { width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--eaten); position: relative; flex: none; }
  [data-ui] .seal::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 4.5px; top: 2.5px; width: 3px; height: 6px; border: solid var(--card); border-width: 0 1.5px 1.5px 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }

  [data-ui] .offrow { position: relative; background: var(--bg); border-radius: var(--radius-row); padding: 12px 14px 12px 28px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; }
  [data-ui] .offrow__mark { position: absolute; left: 12px; top: 13px; bottom: 13px; width: 4px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--amber); }
  [data-ui] .offrow__line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; }
  [data-ui] .offrow__line strong { font-weight: 600; }
  [data-ui] .offrow__line > .nums { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  [data-ui] .offrow__sub { margin-top: 2px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--label2); align-items: center; }
  [data-ui] .chip { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--amber); background: var(--amber-wash); white-space: nowrap; }
  [data-ui] .offverdict { margin-top: 6px; color: var(--label2); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; max-width: none; }
  [data-ui] .offverdict strong { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }

  [data-ui] .stepper { justify-self: start; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px auto 44px; align-items: center; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px; }
  [data-ui] .stepper span { text-align: center; color: var(--key); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 44px; }
  [data-ui] .stepper strong { padding-inline: 0.75rem; font-family: var(--font-mark); font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

  [data-ui] .floats { font-size: 13px; color: var(--label2); }
  .tile__ui--bar :global(.mbar__dot) { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--card); }

  [data-ui] .set { display: grid; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 14px; padding: 2px 14px; font-size: 15px; }
  [data-ui] .set li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 11px 0; }
  [data-ui] .set li + li { border-top: 1px solid var(--separator); }
  [data-ui] .set li span:last-child { color: var(--label2); }

  @media (max-width: 64em) {
    .board { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .tile--7, .tile--5, .tile--4 { grid-column: auto; }
    .tile { min-height: 0; }
  }
</style>
